"güvenlik analizinde kullanım için kullanıcı kuruluşun kendi kalite güvence programı "
"ve bağımsız gözden geçirmesi ayrıca gerekir. Kaynağı gösterilemeyen eşik konmaz; "
"eşikler profilde ayarlanabilir."
msgstr ""
"This program certifies conformity with no standard and cannot approve an analysis as "
"\"compliant with a standard\". What it does is produce the evidence that the "
"standards and good practice would ask for a run or a model, and make the gaps "
"visible. Use in facility licensing or safety analysis additionally requires the user "
"organization's own quality assurance programme and an independent review. No "
"threshold is set without a source that can be cited; the thresholds can be adjusted "
"in the profile."

