"bulmak için Analiz sekmesinde 'Kritik arama' ile 'Kontrol çubuğu daldırma' "
"parametresini kullanın."
msgstr ""
"The control rod is inserted from the top: 0% fully withdrawn, 100% fully inserted. "
"The part of the absorber region below the tip is filled with the follower material. "
"To find the critical rod position, use 'Critical search' with the 'Control rod "
"insertion' parameter in the Analysis tab."

