"ek malzemenin kesin hacmi gerekir."
msgstr ""
"Materials other than fuel that take part in the depletion calculation (e.g. a "
"structural material whose activation is tracked). Fissile materials and burnable "
"absorbers take part automatically. Every additional material needs an exact volume."

