"hesaplanır: U₃Si₂ (12.2 g/cm³) + Al (2.70 g/cm³)."
msgstr ""
"Void volume fraction in the fuel layer (0–0.3). The density is computed from the U "
"loading and this value: U₃Si₂ (12.2 g/cm³) + Al (2.70 g/cm³)."

